      "q": "41. Complete the following table:\nIon\nNumber of electrons\nZ\nN\nA\n${}^{86}R{{b}^{+}}_{37}$\n${}^{24}M{{g}^{2+}}_{12}$\n${}^{80}B{{r}^{-}}_{35}$",
